  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "heading_lead",
    "value_nl": "Van boer tot fles, ",
    "value_en": "From farmer to bottle, "
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_1_body",
    "value_nl": "Alles begint bij de druif. We werken met een select netwerk van wijnboeren uit heel Europa, die stuk voor stuk biologisch telen en met de hand oogsten op het juiste moment.",
    "value_en": "It all begins with the grape. We work with a select network of farmers from all across Europe, each of them growing organically and harvesting by hand at exactly the right moment."
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_1_title",
    "value_nl": "De druif",
    "value_en": "The grape"
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_2_body",
    "value_nl": "Elke druif reist gekoeld van de boer naar Amsterdam. Het klinkt als transport, maar het is eigenlijk al het begin van de wijn: op de snelweg gebeuren de eerste stappen van de fermentatie.",
    "value_en": "Every grape travels chilled from the farmer to Amsterdam. It sounds like transport, but it’s actually already the beginning of the wine: the first steps of fermentation happen right there on the highway."
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_2_title",
    "value_nl": "De reis",
    "value_en": "The journey"
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_3_body",
    "value_nl": "Hier krijgt de wijn zijn vorm. Staal, beton of amfora, ons eigen lab bewaakt elke stap van het proces, zodat elke wijn zijn eigen karakter krijgt.",
    "value_en": "Here the wine takes shape. Steel, concrete or amphora, our own lab oversees every step of the process, so each wine develops its own character."
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_3_title",
    "value_nl": "De winery",
    "value_en": "The winery"
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_4_body",
    "value_nl": "De laatste stap is de fles. Hier komt alles samen: de druif, de reis en de ambacht in de winery. Nu is de wijn klaar om van genoten te worden. ",
    "value_en": "The last step is the bottle. That's where everything comes together: the grape, the journey, and the craft from the winery. Now the wine is ready to be enjoyed."
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "step_4_title",
    "value_nl": "De fles",
    "value_en": "The bottle"
  },
  {
    "page": "home",
    "section": "process",
    "field_key": "sub_text",
    "value_nl": "Wij verplaatsen de druif, niet de wijn. Daardoor kan je hier van dichtbij mee maken hoe wijn écht gemaakt wordt.",
    "value_en": "We move the grape, not the wine. This lets you experience close-up how wine is truly made."
  },
